use anyhow :: { Context , Result } ; use std :: fs ; use std :: path :: { Path , PathBuf } ; use std :: process :: Command ; use std :: sync :: { Arc , Mutex } ; use std :: collections :: { HashMap , HashSet } ; use std :: io :: { BufRead , BufReader } ; use rayon :: prelude :: * ; use log :: { info , error , warn } ; use serde :: { Serialize , Deserialize } ; use regex ; use crate :: global_dep_graph :: { GlobalDependencyGraph , GlobalDependencyGraphBuilder } ; # [doc = " Create parallel build groups based on dependency analysis"] pub fn create_parallel_build_groups (flake_files : Vec < PathBuf > , max_group_size : usize ,) -> Vec < Vec < PathBuf > > { if max_group_size == 0 { return vec ! [flake_files] ; } let mut groups = Vec :: new () ; let mut current_group = Vec :: new () ; for flake_file in flake_files { current_group . push (flake_file) ; if current_group . len () >= max_group_size { groups . push (current_group) ; current_group = Vec :: new () ; } } if ! current_group . is_empty () { groups . push (current_group) ; } groups }